# PR Diff Truncated

Original size: 33183 characters.
Kept: first 7800 and last 4200 characters.

The full diff is available in the checked-out PR branch. Use `git diff` or CodeGraph for focused source navigation instead of relying only on this file.

```diff
diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 95106eb884..2f4248357c 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -13,6 +13,25 @@ block a release again.

 ## Unreleased

+- fix(#1947): `schedule_message` from the orchestrator no longer misroutes
+  into a finished subagent's mailbox. A background shell job started by a
+  CHILD registered its settle continuation inside the child's subagent
+  zone; when the job settled after the child's run ended, the CLI's
+  settle-wake (`_onShellJobSettled` → `_startRun`) started MAIN's reaction
+  run still carrying the finished child's `activeSubagentId()`, and every
+  identity consumer of that run misattributed it — the reported shape was
+  a self-reminder scheduled "in <session>/<child>" that auto-resumed the
+  completed child (duplicate-release risk). Three layers: the
+  `ShellJobRegistry` now binds its settle continuation to the
+  construction-time (boot) zone (`_bootZone.run`), both hosts'
+  `scheduleSenderMailbox` wiring trusts the zone scope only while the
+  child is genuinely in flight on the session executor
+  (`TaskExecutor.isInFlight`), and the tool response names the RECIPIENT
+  the record carries — an explicit `to:` used to be shadowed in the reply
+  by the sender's mailbox, which read as "the override was ignored" even
+  when it was honored. E2E repro drives the real AgentCli
+  (test/cli/agent_cli_schedule_recipient_test.dart) plus a registry-level
+  zone pin (test/tools/shell_job_settle_zone_test.dart).
 - fix(#1941): the selected CodeMie project now rides EVERY model request.
   The header is baked into `Model.headers` only by the connect-time
   switches (gh-1809), so every other rebuild silently dropped
diff --git a/flutter_app/lib/services/agent_service_host_builder.dart b/flutter_app/lib/services/agent_service_host_builder.dart
index 55a595a0aa..562ee163ec 100644
--- a/flutter_app/lib/services/agent_service_host_builder.dart
+++ b/flutter_app/lib/services/agent_service_host_builder.dart
@@ -50,10 +50,16 @@ extension AgentServiceHostBuilder on AgentService {
     scheduledMessages: _scheduledMessages,
     scheduleSenderMailbox: () {
       // Inside a subagent run "your own mailbox" is the CHILD's — the
-      // queue's selfMailbox always resolves main (gh-970).
+      // queue's selfMailbox always resolves main (gh-970). gh-1947 guard:
+      // the scope is trusted only while the child is genuinely in flight —
+      // a stale zone value (a settle continuation outliving the child's
+      // run) must never re-address MAIN's self-reminders into the
+      // finished child's mailbox.
       final id = activeSubagentId();
       final manager = _subagentManager;
       if (id == null || manager == null) return null;
+      final executor = _taskConfig?.executor;
+      if (executor != null && !executor.isInFlight(id)) return null;
       return manager.mailboxOf(id);
     },
     onAsk: (questions) => _answerAskQuestions(questions),
diff --git a/lib/src/cli/agent_cli_inbox.dart b/lib/src/cli/agent_cli_inbox.dart
index d6e4799acd..0dc62f0fc2 100644
--- a/lib/src/cli/agent_cli_inbox.dart
+++ b/lib/src/cli/agent_cli_inbox.dart
@@ -174,9 +174,18 @@ extension AgentCliMessagingFlow on AgentCli {
   /// the main agent (gh-970). `schedule_message` resolves "your own
   /// mailbox" through this — the queue's `selfMailbox` always names MAIN,
   /// so without it every child self-reminder landed in main's inbox.
+  ///
+  /// gh-1947 guard: a zone value can OUTLIVE the child's run — a settle
+  /// continuation registered inside a child's scope (its background shell
+  /// job) used to start MAIN's wake run still carrying the finished
+  /// child's id. The scope is therefore trusted only while that child is
+  /// genuinely in flight on the session executor; otherwise the caller is
+  /// MAIN and its self-reminders must default to MAIN's mailbox.
   String? _childSenderMailbox() {
     final id = activeSubagentId();
-    return id == null ? null : _subagentManager.mailboxOf(id);
+    if (id == null) return null;
+    if (!_taskConfig.executor.isInFlight(id)) return null;
+    return _subagentManager.mailboxOf(id);
   }

   /// Namespaces this instance's mailboxes with the active session id: two
diff --git a/lib/src/messaging/schedule_message_tool.dart b/lib/src/messaging/schedule_message_tool.dart
index 12d29dff5e..c801db3f70 100644
--- a/lib/src/messaging/schedule_message_tool.dart
+++ b/lib/src/messaging/schedule_message_tool.dart
@@ -82,10 +82,11 @@ AgentTool scheduleMessageTool(
         );
       }
       final sender = senderMailbox?.call();
+      final to = (args['to'] as String?) ?? sender;
       final id = await queue.schedule(
         text: text.trim(),
         delay: delay,
-        to: (args['to'] as String?) ?? sender,
+        to: to,
         from: sender,
       );
       final due = DateTime.now().add(delay).toIso8601String();
@@ -94,9 +95,13 @@ AgentTool scheduleMessageTool(
